"smart_blocks:Computer Science/JavaScript/JavaScript Strict Mode ('use strict').md#FF5582A6;\">undeclared variables throw ReferenceError instead of creating global variables, assignments to non-writable properties throw TypeError, deleting undeletable properties throws errors, function parameter names must be unique, octal numeric literals are prohibited, and the `this` value in functions is `undefined` instead of the global object</mark>. The mode can be applied globally to an entire script or locally to individual functions, but cannot be canceled once activated.": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.02224506,-0.00345461,0.02930891,-0.02364594,-0.00157744,0.00397403,0.01249703,0.02981458,0.03433585,0.02122691,-0.01060495,0.01346822,0.02248777,0.00866059,-0.0717743,-0.00159443,-0.06230582,0.07829351,-0.07329539,0.01208164,0.1848463,-0.00821265,0.01732761,-0.017133,-0.00097053,0.04313952,-0.02665371,-0.03285763,-0.01005449,-0.19895357,-0.09194826,-0.03649466,-0.01298643,-0.00838617,-0.02359798,-0.0572134,-0.02117354,-0.00772758,-0.03973977,0.04805277,0.03294162,0.05331908,0.05574179,-0.0571322,-0.01510696,-0.05718296,-0.08493695,-0.01182329,0.00162321,-0.02165212,-0.00848944,-0.03056456,0.0096059,-0.01371655,0.01674715,0.02107787,0.03795838,0.08350613,0.00446353,0.05706707,0.03256368,0.01995341,-0.16242494,0.05489783,0.04145128,0.03506747,0.02607345,-0.03935647,0.02026203,-0.01003525,0.00162506,-0.0037517,-0.00084476,0.12024483,0.0434317,-0.02178176,-0.0262105,-0.03609355,-0.01124688,0.04676622,-0.05979339,-0.10924899,-0.00620722,-0.00362879,-0.04257547,-0.03084925,-0.0096836,-0.02950146,0.06540466,0.05018702,0.0015755,-0.05927015,0.10442585,0.04324567,-0.01959984,-0.03163876,0.03749546,0.00777268,-0.06830883,0.09650247,-0.05484714,-0.00118015,-0.02237905,0.00844748,0.02291021,0.01779755,-0.04677652,-0.06442003,-0.02810264,-0.01589759,-0.04938784,-0.01542166,0.04510418,-0.04676292,-0.02743186,0.06103561,0.01837016,-0.04050979,0.00812071,-0.